{"type":"standard","title":"Khroskyabs language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Khroskyabs language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q3118757","titles":{"canonical":"Khroskyabs_language","normalized":"Khroskyabs language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Khroskyabs language</span></span>"},"pageid":33244978,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Khroskyabs_map.jpg/330px-Khroskyabs_map.jpg","width":330,"height":264},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/Khroskyabs_map.jpg","width":1588,"height":1272},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1355076015","tid":"8d05f60a-53c0-11f1-8979-76ed918ad9af","timestamp":"2026-05-19T20:23:09Z","description":"Gyalrongic language of China","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khroskyabs_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khroskyabs_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khroskyabs_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Khroskyabs_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khroskyabs_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Khroskyabs_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khroskyabs_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Khroskyabs_language"}},"extract":"Khroskyabs is a Gyalrongic language of China. It is called Guanyinqiao in Ethnologue after a town in western Sichuan where one dialect of the language is spoken, Thugsrje Chenbo. It has been referred to as Lavrung in previous publications.","extract_html":"<p><b>Khroskyabs</b> is a Gyalrongic language of China. It is called <i>Guanyinqiao</i> in <i>Ethnologue</i> after a town in western Sichuan where one dialect of the language is spoken, Thugsrje Chenbo. It has been referred to as <i>Lavrung</i> in previous publications.</p>"}